## C — Pre-flight checks

1. Tip worktree; clean `git status`; named branch (not detached junk).
2. `app.config.js` version == gradle `versionName`; `versionCode` **not** in `tools/release/built_versioncodes.txt`.
3. `powershell -File tools/release/RUN_PRE_RELEASE_REGRESSION_GATE.ps1 -ExpectedVersionCode <VC>` → `RESULT=PASS` (clean tree, streaming ON, no loopback live/API URLs, purchases not disabled, `USE_LIVE_SERVICE_WALLET=true`, signing env present, no stale mutable `app-release.aab`).
4. Bake only: `BUILD_RELEASE_CANDIDATE.ps1 -ExpectedVersionCode <VC>` (`BLYP_CANONICAL_RELEASE=1`, matching `BLYP_EXPECTED_VERSION_CODE`).
5. `.env.production` + `eas.json` `build.production.env`: streaming ON, live URL non-localhost, purchases enabled, live-service wallet, game flags as intended, Firebase key present.
6. Client SKUs == `backend/.../iapCatalog.ts` ANDROID grants (incl. 2000 & 10000).
7. Admin deploy source = tip `admin/` (restyle + Mel), not orphan eas-modern-only.
8. Post-bake: frozen AAB under `diagnostics/release_aab/CANONICAL_PLAY_AAB_*/app-release.aab`; bundletool manifest VC/VN match; SHA-256 + size in packet.
9. **Cinema size gate (when cinema gifts are claimed in the ship):**
   - **FAIL if canonical AAB < 180 MB** (full tip ~206 MB; no-cinema ~98 MB).
   - **FAIL if AAB has < 15 cinema gift MP4s in `base/res/raw`** (or raw cinema MP4 payload < ~35 MB); full tip ≈ 20 / ~42 MB.
   - Note: Play device download (~150–160 MB) ≠ AAB file size (~206 MB); do **not** treat ~80 MB as "full tip".
10. `GET <LIVE_SERVICE_URL>/health` 200; revision matches ship; admin tip chrome + Mel credit.
11. Billing proof = Play internal install only (never debug-signed adb).
12. Spot-check on Play build: For You swipe/audio; Go Live + guest loudspeaker; Frenemies spin/queue/jump/life; send+**receive** gift cinema; convert gems; one Play purchase; SafetyGate host create.
13. Upload only when asked: `npm run play:upload` (internal) → report Play URL, VC, VN, track.

## D — Never ship

- Debug-signed / `BLYP_ALLOW_DEBUG_SIGNED_RELEASE` as Play or IAP “proof”
- Dirty / mixed / non-tip tree as the Play client
- Tip-old admin without restyle, or eas-modern admin without Mel/tip RBAC
- Client ahead of live-service for Frenemies paid actions, convert, battles settle, gifts
- Loopback live/API URLs; `DISABLE_PURCHASES=true`; wallet not on live-service
- Firebase stub / missing baked key; reused `versionCode`; non-canonical AAB rails
- Half-cake as the declared Play build; unlock-freezes churn without Alex unlock
- Local GBP lock overriding Play `formattedPrice`; oversell titles vs grants
- Declaring convert/gifts/Fold audio fixed from UI-only without server/receiver proof
- Cinema-claimed ship with canonical AAB < 180 MB, or < 15 cinema gift MP4s in `base/res/raw` (or raw cinema MP4 payload < ~35 MB); do not confuse Play download size (~150–160 MB) or ~80 MB with full-tip AAB (~206 MB)

